cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below, and cite the original publisher of any figure you use."
type: dataset
title: "Data Centre PUE Benchmarks"
abstract: >
  Publicly disclosed Power Usage Effectiveness (PUE) figures for data centres, each traced to its
  publisher: Google fleet and campus trailing-12-month PUE, AWS fleet and cloud-region PUE, Microsoft
  regional PUE, Equinix and Digital Realty portfolio PUE, the Uptime Institute global survey average
  2007-2025, the European Commission's 2024 EU average from Energy Efficiency Directive reporting,
  and the NLR ESIF data centre. Values are copied exactly as published, with source URL, period,
  measurement scope and retrieval date for every row.
